 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "house and street are lists of trade strings \"SYMBOL,SIDE,QUANTITY,ID\": SYMBOL is 1 to 4 capital letters left-padded with spaces to 4 characters, SIDE is \"B\" or \"S\", QUANTITY is 4 digits and ID is 6 capital letters or digits. Trades may repeat. Level 1: a house trade and a street trade match when their strings are identical; each trade matches at most one other trade, so matching is one-to-one on multisets. Return every trade (from either list) left unmatched, sorted by code point.",
